OL,3,AGreen councillors face Labour deadline
OL,4,Ato disown Zionism policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour is set to decide whether to end
OL,7,Fpower-sharing with Green councillors
OL,8,Fafter demanding they disown their
OL,9,Fparty's policy that Zionism is a form
OL,10,Fof racism.
OL,12,FThe BBC has been told Green groups have
OL,13,Fbeen given until Sunday to respond to
OL,14,Fthe demand, after which Labour's ruling
OL,15,FNational Executive Committee (NEC) will
OL,16,Fdecide whether the party will continue
OL,17,Fwith local deals to share power.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
