OL,3,AGreen councillors face Labour deadline
OL,4,Ato disown Zionism policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen groups in some areas have
OL,7,Fpublicly stated they do not agree with
OL,8,Fthe policy or have distanced themselves
OL,9,Ffrom it, reducing the likelihood the
OL,10,Fpacts will end.
OL,12,FBut in other areas Green councillors
OL,13,Fare yet to specify where they stand on
OL,14,Fthe issue, meaning local alliances
OL,15,Fappear more vulnerable to collapse.
